{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26648","headline":"寄狄拾遗时爲魏州从事 · 姚合","name":"寄狄拾遗时爲魏州从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少在兵马间，长还系戎职。\n鸡飞不得远，岂要生羽翼。\n三年城中游，与君最相识。\n应知我中肠，不苟念衣食。\n主人树勳名，欲灭天下贼。\n愚虽乏智谋，愿陈一夫力。\n人生须气健，饥冻缚不得。\n睡当一席宽，觉乃千里窄。\n古人不惧死，所惧死无益。\n至交不可合，一合难离坼。\n君尝相劝勉，苦语毒胸臆。\n百年心知同，谁限河南北。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26648.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26648","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}